    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About SVJ</string>
    <string name="about_description">Sportverein Jestetten 1920 e.V. is a football club based in Jestetten, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.
Founded on 1 March 1920 and registered since 1968, the club competes in the Kreisliga A – Ost of the
South Baden Football Association (SBFV) in the Hochrhein district. The club is known for its strong
community spirit, youth development, and dedication to grassroots football.</string>
